'''Biome Settlers Skin Pack 1'''<ref>{{Cite|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20151227192516/http://mojang.com/2015/11/biome-settlers-pack-1-now-available-for-download/|title=Biome Settlers Pack 1 now available for download|website=Mojang.com|author=Owen Hill|date=November 20, 2015}}</ref> is a [[skin pack]] themed around the inhabitants of the [[tundra]], [[forest]] and [[desert]] biomes. In January 2026, the skin pack was delisted from the Marketplace in {{BE}}, though it is still available in [[Legacy Console Edition]] on some platforms. The skin pack can still be obtained on ''Bedrock Edition'' if purchased on Legacy Console Edition.

